After earnestly collecting and analyzing the comments and questions raised by many players, we have made overall upgrades and changes to the game.

      1. Game sound effects;
      2. change the location of Audio-Teaching NPC;
      3. Hidden elements (such as maps of six-story towers  and money );
      4. Changes in the frequency of brush strange;
      5. Adjustment the mount of monster-drop-money 

Your recognition of the game is our greatest affirmation (๑•̀ᄇ•́) و✧
“Listen your thoughts, creative your want” , we will continue to follow this belief.

Finally, thank you again.
